d if they wish. \r\n\r\nI understand/read English, but I can't communicate in English, even in Portuguese, which is my native language, I have difficulty, as well as with C++, and I try to use LLM to help me.But all the effort comes from me; I test, correct, revise, and end up letting LLM errors slip through, but I'm trying my best. \r\n\r\nIf this pull request is not approved, I will no longer contribute to the engine. Goodbye","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3739595936/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3739601773","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114884#issuecomment-3739601773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114884","id":3739601773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e5ctt","user":{"login":"brunosrz","id":244238563,"node_id":"U_kgDODo7I4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244238563?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz","html_url":"https://github.com/brunosrz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brunosrz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T17:12:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T1